{"id": "P0237", "style": "", "text": "Pre-Built Models | Model Heights", "links": [], "images": [], "comments": ["47"], "heading": ""}
{"id": "P0238", "style": "", "text": "All pre-built models in the modular experience are 15” high, but many of these Pre-Built models are the slimmer 11” height. Please mirror the dimensions of models in the 2D Pre-Render Experience.", "links": ["https://www.hastingsbathcollection.com/products/vanities/urban-low-height?UI_Model=24%25201DW_24"], "images": [], "comments": [], "heading": ""}
{"id": "P0239", "style": "", "text": "You’ll notice that when I select a slimmer 11” height model, the pre-built selection does not remain selected; it reverts to the taller 15” height. See the recording.", "links": ["https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tYzvIUa3s1ejNUTJ7XlRUtXURzU187AX"], "images": [], "comments": [], "heading": ""}
